      "hints": [
        "Write the diffraction-grating equation for each maximum.",
        "The grating spacing and angle are the same for both maxima, so equate the two expressions."
      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "For a diffraction grating, d sin θ = nλ.",
        "At the shared angle, 3λ₁ = d sin θ for the third-order maximum and 4λ₂ = d sin θ for the fourth-order maximum.",
        "Therefore 3λ₁ = 4λ₂, so λ₂ / λ₁ = 3 / 4 = 0.75."
      ],
